        "execSummary":  "Google\u0027s AI-for-science strategy signals that enterprise AI value is increasingly measured by societal impact and mission outcomes, not just efficiency gains. The bundling of health, climate resilience, education, and workforce tools under a unified AI strategy reflects a maturing enterprise narrative—AI as infrastructure, not novelty. For customer-support leaders, the WeatherNext and AlphaGenome examples illustrate how domain-specific AI models outperform general tools when trained on deep vertical data. Vendor-agnostic, outcome-first AI governance frameworks will be critical as enterprise AI expands beyond productivity into mission-critical operations.",
