        "execSummary":  "Project Suncatcher represents Google\u0027s long-horizon bet on sovereign AI compute infrastructure beyond terrestrial data centers—a strategic signal about where next-generation AI capacity constraints will be solved. For enterprise AI planners, this is a 3-5 year story, but it foreshadows a future where inference latency, energy costs, and geopolitical data-residency regulations drive compute off-planet. The immediate enterprise implication is less about space and more about recognizing that hyperscalers are investing in novel compute substrates that will reshape pricing and availability of AI infrastructure. Watch for how TPU roadmaps evolve in tandem with this initiative.",
