        "summary":  "Anthropic unveiled Claude Opus 5.5, the first model in the Claude 5.5 family, delivering performance comparable to Claude Fable 5.1 while cutting operational costs by 40%. The model excels in agentic coding, knowledge work, and complex reasoning tasks, with improved safety scores and enhanced natural communication capabilities. Opus 5.5 includes strengthened safeguards for cybersecurity and biology applications with verified access programs for qualified researchers.",
